hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1000","Ahmad bin Abdah told us, Abdul Aziz, meaning Ibn Muhammad al-Darawardi, told us, on the authority of Suhail, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, that the Prophet May God’s prayers and peace be upon him, he addressed the people and admonished them, then he said: “O women, you are the majority of the people of Hell.” Then a large woman said: “Why? That? He said: “Because of the abundance of cursing, and the disbelief of the clan, and I have not seen women who are deficient in reason and religion, they are more powerful than those of understanding and opinion among you.” She said Woman: What is lacking in our minds and our religion? He said: “The testimony of two of you is the testimony of a man, and the loss of your religion is menstruation. One of you will spend three or four days without praying.”"
